  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place mayonnaise, vinegar, water, lemon juice, Parmesan cheese, olive oil, garlic, oregano, basil, and black pepper into a blender. Blend for 2 minutes, then pour into a salad dressing container and refrigerate, at least 1 hour. Shake well before using.",
